tc.. are on 5th Floor level. La Serena has world-class amenities, where you can spend your days out in the open with landscapes intended to fascinate you. Builder possession within 3.5 to 4 years.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹31,000\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹37,500**\n\n17% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Kandivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹25,373/sqft\n\nmedian · 34 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹75.8/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.6%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹31,000/sqft** — **22% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2028\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n2 BHK715–975 ft²₹2.22 Cr–₹3.02 Cr\n\n3 BHK1,025–1,310 ft²₹3.18 Cr–₹4.06 Cr\n\n4 BHK1,575 ft²₹4.88 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20La%20Serena%20Tower%205%2C%20Tower%206%20And%20Tower%207%20(RERA%20P51800050593))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51800050593\n\nRegistered\n\n2025-08-12\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\nHDFC BANK\n\nArchitect\n\nArun Pagnis\n\nTotal FSI\n\n29490\n\n04\n\n## Buildings · 3 Wing(s)\n\nLa Serena Tower 524 floors · 66 units\n\nLa Serena Tower 624 floors · 66 units\n\nLa Serena Tower 724 floors · 33 units\n\n05\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n**Redevelopment / SRA / MHADA / MMRDA / Freehold** — provenance from MPE's verification layer. The genesis no portal shows.\n\n06\n\n## Location\n\n📍 Kandivali West  \n19.2101724,72.8747195\n\n▸ Explore map & Street View — for verified buyers\n\n07\n\n## Promoter & Professionals\n\nPEBBLE PARK DEVELOPERS LLPNA\n\nARUN PAGNISArchitect\n\n0