Flats for sale in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n6. /\n7. [New Projects in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/new-projects-in-mumbai)\n8. /\n9. [New Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai/buy/real-estate-projects-in-kandivali-west)\n10. /\n11. La Serena\n\n# La Serena\n\nFlats by **[Pebbles Realty](/mumbai/buy/projects-by-pebbles-realty)** at La Serena, MG Cross Road Number 4, next to Achija Restaurant, Amrut Nagar, Patel Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nRERA\n\nP51800050593\n\nAgent RERA - A51700000043\n\nINR2.59 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nINR2.59 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nConfigurations2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\nPossession DateDec 2028\n\nBuilt up AreaOn request\n\nCarpet Area715 - 1,575\n\n* Sq.ft\n* Sq.yrd\n* Sq.mtr\n* Acres\n\nMin. Price per Sqft.INR 36.22 K per Sqft.\n\n[![Rera Kerala]()https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nP51800050593\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/pebble-la-serena-tower/222697/project","title":"Pebble La Serena Tower, Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹2.60 Cr Onwards | 2, 3, 4 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Pebble Park Developers developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/pebble-park-developers-18425-7006.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Pebble La Serena Tower Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Pebble La Serena Tower Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/pebble-la-serena-tower-project-project-large-image1-5551.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Pebble La Serena Tower Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/pebble-la-serena-tower-project-amenities-features1-8729.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Pebble La Serena Tower Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/pebble-la-serena-tower-project-amenities-features4-8099.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Pebble La Serena Tower Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-pebble-la-serena-tower-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹2.60 Cr - 5.76 Cr**\n\n₹35,950 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Pebble La Serena Tower?\n\n## About Pebble La Serena Tower, Kandivali West by Pebble Park Developers\n\nThe Pebble La Serena Tower is a premier residential project located in Kandivali West, offering a unique blend of luxury and comfort. With its strategic location, the project is well-connected to major highways, including Swami Vivekanand Road and Western Express Highway, making it easily accessible from various parts of the city. The project is registered under RERA with certificate number P51800050593.\n\nThe project boasts a range of modern amenities, including a gymnasium, power backup, and more. The apartments are designed with precision, featuring superior specifications such as oil-bound distemper walls in the master bedroom. The Pebble La Serena Tower is an ideal choice for those seeking a luxurious and hassle-free lifestyle. Whether you re a young professional or a growing family, this project has something to offer for everyone.\n\nFor those looking to invest in a luxury apartment, the project offers a range of unit options to choose from. The available unit options include 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments with areas ranging from 715 Sq. Ft. to 1150 Sq. Ft., priced between 2.29 Cr and 3.68 Cr. The project also offers a spacious 4 BHK apartment with an area of 1575 Sq. Ft., priced at 5.04 Cr.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Pebble La Serena Tower:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 715 | 2.29 Cr |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 765 | 2.45 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1025 | 3.28 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1150 | 3.68 Cr |\n| 4 BHK Apartment | 1575 | 5.04 Cr |\n\nThe residential property is strategically located near several notable landmarks, providing residents with easy access to essential amenities and services. These landmarks not only enhance the quality of life for residents but also offer a unique blend of convenience and comfort.\n\nRecent government-registered transactions in the real estate market reveal a surge in activity, with the 1-year aggregation witnessing 15 sales transactions valued at 41 Cr, indicating a significant rise in investment opportunities. Meanwhile, the 6-month aggregation saw 9 sales transactions totaling 25 Cr, showcasing a consistent trend of growth. Notably, the 3-month aggregation recorded 4 sales transactions, valued at 11 Cr, demonstrating a promising start to the year. As the current rate settles at 26,166, it will be interesting to observe the future trajectory of the market, following a price movement of + 813 over the past 3 months and + 1,828 over the past 6 months.\n\n## Pebble La Serena Tower Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Pebble La Serena Tower.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  715 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.60 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  765 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.80 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1025 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.75 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1150 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 4.21 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1575 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 5.76 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nPebble La Serena Tower's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Kandivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Pebble La Serena Tower | Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 35950 | 27000 |\n| Mar 2026 | 30400 | 25100 |\n| Dec 2025 | 29350 | 25750 |\n| Sep 2025 | 30700 | 27100 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nPebble La Serena Tower avg. price is ₹ 36 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Kandivali West at ₹ 27 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Godrej Reserve Kandivali](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/godrej-reserve-kandivali/243614/project \"Godrej Reserve Kandivali\") | ₹ 42,450 |\n| Current Project **Pebble La Serena Tower** | ₹ 35,950 |\n| [Chandak Treesourus](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-treesourus/213009/project \"Chandak Treesourus\") | ₹ 35,400 |\n| [Mahindra Vista](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mahindra-vista/243232/project \"Mahindra Vista\") | ₹ 30,700 |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 27,000 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Kandivali West ranges from ₹ 24.2 K to ₹ 75.6 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Pebble La Serena Tower | In Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 35 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 49.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 75.6 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Pebble La Serena Tower.\n\nA total of 7 residential transactions has been registered so far for Pebble La Serena Tower, amounting to ₹ 17 Cr till September 2026.\n\n#### MMRDA Plans Two New Ring Roads to Ease Mumbai Traffic\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) is planning two additional ring routes, expanding its proposed network from seven to nine. These new corridors will cover approximately 307 km and will connect existing roads and planned projects across Mumbai, Thane, and Navi Mumbai.\n\n#### New Road Link Approved to Enhance Mumbai Connectivity\n\nThe Maharashtra government has approved a ₹1,722 crore road link project aimed at connecting the Versova-Bandra Sea Link with the Mumbai Coastal Road. This infrastructure development is expected to significantly improve traffic flow, reduce commuting times across the city.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Pebble La Serena Tower moved from ₹ 30,400/sqft to ₹ 35,950/sqft, reflecting a 18.26% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### Goregaon-Mulund Link Road Project Receives ₹2,650 Crore in BMC Budget\n\nThe Goregaon-Mulund Link Road project has been allocated ₹2,650 crore in the BMC's FY26-27 budget. This crucial east-west connectivity project, which involves the construction of a 4.7 km twin-tube tunnel under the Sanjay Gandhi National Park, aims to ease traffic congestion on the Ghodbunder Road.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Pebble La Serena Tower moved from ₹ 29,350/sqft to ₹ 30,400/sqft, reflecting a 3.58% rise.\n\nStructural Works reach 163% completion, Internal finishing stands at 5%.\n\n### Govt. Registrations